          898.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The testing procedure for the phosphate buffered saline (PBS) adsorption was based on ASTM international standard D570-81 standard test method for water adsorption of plastics. Three samples of each batch were cut into 60 mm by 10 mm strips and placed in test-tubes and dried in an oven for 24 hr at a temperature of 50 °C. Samples were immersed in PBS at a temperature of 50 °C."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
