          73.0,
          297.0,
          495.0,
          450.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The tensile testing procedure used was based on the ASTM international standard D882-02 standard test method for tensile properties of thin plastic sheeting. The samples were cut into tensile samples using a dumbbell cutter, which gave a sample test length of 20 mm and a width of 4 mm. Five samples were tested from each batch using a Lloyd Lrx Tensile tester, with Nexygen software. A cross-head speed of 20 mm/min was used during all tests."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
      "condition_id": "mc004",
