          495.0,
          561.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The contact angles of water on the thin film polymers were measured using a Rame-Hart Goniometer at room temperature (20 °C). The drops were made using a Gilson Pipetman set to 0.1 ml."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
